      <p class="vsw-wcu-active-desc" id="vswWcuDesc">Vidhyut i.e. electricity is very crucial and is on the verge of extinction. To save vidhyut, we are here with Vidhyut Saathi energy saver card that will help you save 20% to 30% on your electricity bills.</p>
